WEBVTT

00:13.096 --> 00:16.141
<i>He is Ranma of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i>

00:17.225 --> 00:19.644
<i>She is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.</i>

00:20.854 --> 00:24.024
<i>The two of them are now engaged
due to their parents' decision.</i>

00:24.524 --> 00:26.192
Don't decide who I'll marry.

00:26.276 --> 00:27.318
It's irritating.

00:28.903 --> 00:31.448
<i>And Ranma has a problem.</i>

00:35.076 --> 00:36.494
What the hell are you doing?

00:37.704 --> 00:40.957
<i>He transforms into a girl
when he's splashed with water.</i>

00:46.296 --> 00:50.550
RANMA1/2

02:12.632 --> 02:14.717
SHAMPOO CLEANS UP

02:14.801 --> 02:16.136
The Kiss of Death.

02:16.636 --> 02:20.181
I'll chase you to the depths of hell
and kill you.

02:20.265 --> 02:21.808
Don't worry.

02:21.891 --> 02:23.434
I won't run or hide.

02:24.352 --> 02:26.020
I'll settle this right here and now.

02:32.986 --> 02:34.112
<i>Akane!</i>

02:34.195 --> 02:36.865
<i>Akane!</i>

02:37.448 --> 02:38.575
<i>Akane!</i>

02:46.374 --> 02:47.542
Akane!

02:49.252 --> 02:50.420
Akane.

02:53.256 --> 02:57.677
Akane!

03:01.347 --> 03:02.515
Akane!

03:13.776 --> 03:15.737
Who are you?

03:17.030 --> 03:20.658
What happened?
What went down between you and Shampoo?

03:21.618 --> 03:23.161
Shampoo...

03:23.244 --> 03:24.412
Akane...

03:25.538 --> 03:26.706
<i>If I remember correctly,</i>

03:28.207 --> 03:30.418
<i>I was facing off with Shampoo, and...</i>

03:44.557 --> 03:47.268
<i>Then, what happened next?</i>

03:52.565 --> 03:55.193
My head feels nice
and refreshed for some reason.

03:57.987 --> 03:59.280
Akane!

03:59.364 --> 04:01.783
What is it with you?
You're awfully friendly.

04:01.866 --> 04:02.700
What?

04:02.784 --> 04:03.868
Who are you?

04:03.952 --> 04:04.994
Look here...

04:07.789 --> 04:10.375
Sorry, but have we met somewhere before?

04:18.299 --> 04:19.717
Don't tell me...

04:20.969 --> 04:22.387
You've got amnesia?

04:23.096 --> 04:24.514
There they are.

04:24.597 --> 04:25.598
Akane!

04:26.224 --> 04:27.267
Hey, everyone.

04:29.060 --> 04:30.353
We were worried sick about you.

04:30.853 --> 04:31.854
Are you hurt?

04:31.938 --> 04:33.439
I'm totally okay.

04:33.523 --> 04:35.566
I bet that Shampoo was super strong.

04:36.109 --> 04:39.112
She was nothing. Right, P-chan?

04:39.696 --> 04:41.572
That can't be true.

04:41.656 --> 04:43.074
You got totally knocked out.

04:43.658 --> 04:45.618
So, who are you again?

04:45.702 --> 04:47.370
Come on!

04:47.453 --> 04:49.539
Is he a transfer student or something?

04:51.291 --> 04:53.418
What are you saying, Akane?

04:54.210 --> 04:55.211
What?

04:57.505 --> 04:59.966
We're engaged?

05:00.758 --> 05:03.970
- He's lived with you for a good while now.
- Yeah.

05:04.053 --> 05:05.471
- He's Ranma, remember?
- Yeah.

05:05.555 --> 05:07.432
That's simply not true.

05:08.474 --> 05:09.684
Ranma?

05:11.769 --> 05:13.229
Ranma...

05:14.230 --> 05:15.231
Ranma?

05:17.442 --> 05:18.693
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

05:18.776 --> 05:22.864
<i>Come to think of it, it does ring a bell.</i>

05:24.824 --> 05:28.119
<i>Something feels very nostalgic
about that name.</i>

05:31.247 --> 05:32.915
- Akane?
- What's wrong?

05:35.877 --> 05:38.546
It's the woodwork
between the ceiling and the lintel

05:38.629 --> 05:41.049
installed for ventilation
and lighting purposes.

05:41.132 --> 05:42.508
That's ranma.

05:43.009 --> 05:47.013
A Latin music that originated in Cuba
with a two-four time and dynamic rhythm!

05:47.096 --> 05:48.931
That's rumba!

05:49.015 --> 05:52.518
<i>She's completely forgotten only about me!</i>

05:53.019 --> 05:54.604
Come with me for a sec.

05:55.855 --> 05:57.940
Hey! What are you going to do to P-chan?

05:58.024 --> 05:59.525
We're just gonna chat.

05:59.609 --> 06:00.902
Give him back!

06:00.985 --> 06:02.320
Whoa.

06:10.953 --> 06:13.289
<i>That move... He isn't just anyone.</i>

06:13.790 --> 06:15.833
Who on earth is he?

06:15.917 --> 06:17.460
We told you, he's Ranma.

06:18.044 --> 06:21.964
Hup, two, three, four!

06:26.636 --> 06:29.680
Tell me everything you saw.

06:30.306 --> 06:32.433
What did Shampoo do to Akane?

06:33.976 --> 06:38.773
What makes you think
I'd help Akane remember you?

06:38.856 --> 06:40.191
Ryoga, you bastard!

06:40.691 --> 06:45.279
Keep in mind, this situation
actually works in my favor.

06:45.363 --> 06:46.614
Hup, two, three, four!

06:46.697 --> 06:48.032
Girls!

06:48.116 --> 06:50.451
Come look, I've got
something funny to show you.

06:50.535 --> 06:51.744
What is it?

06:51.828 --> 06:53.454
Cut that out, bastard!

06:55.289 --> 06:58.709
Anyhow, I get chills
just thinking back on it.

07:02.713 --> 07:04.924
<i>That footwork of Shampoo's...</i>

07:16.269 --> 07:17.478
That's all I saw.

07:18.062 --> 07:21.566
To make the story short,
you didn't see a thing!

07:22.066 --> 07:24.068
OSTEOPATHIC CLINIC-CHIROPRACTOR
ACUPUNCTURE-ACUPRESSURE

07:24.152 --> 07:25.486
I see no exterior wounds.

07:26.070 --> 07:28.364
Tell me how you felt when you woke up.

07:28.865 --> 07:31.576
Well, my head felt nice and refreshed.

07:32.076 --> 07:33.703
I see, this must be...

07:34.495 --> 07:36.539
Did you figure something out, Dr. Tofu?

07:37.206 --> 07:38.958
It can only be the legendary demon fist,

07:39.709 --> 07:42.628
Xi Fa Shiang Gao Shiatsu.

07:42.712 --> 07:44.547
What in the world is that?

07:46.090 --> 07:47.717
YOU'RE RIGHT!

07:47.800 --> 07:49.802
Mr. Saotome.

07:50.303 --> 07:52.680
Old Man, you watched the fight?

07:52.763 --> 07:54.682
THE WHOLE SHEBANG!

07:56.726 --> 07:58.102
Turn back to human already.

07:58.186 --> 07:59.896
EVEN NOW AS I...

08:01.022 --> 08:06.694
Even now as I look back on it,
it was nothing short of a master's work.

08:12.950 --> 08:15.411
<i>Her hand manipulations
after gaining Akane's back</i>

08:15.495 --> 08:18.039
<i>was no ordinary feat.</i>

08:26.923 --> 08:31.093
All in a matter of 56 seconds!

08:31.177 --> 08:32.929
That's incredible.

08:33.429 --> 08:36.098
No wonder my head felt so nice.

08:36.182 --> 08:39.101
So how does it relate to all this?

08:39.685 --> 08:42.605
In a nutshell, Xi Fa Shiang Gao Shiatsu

08:43.147 --> 08:45.691
is a dreaded technique
that manipulates memories

08:46.817 --> 08:48.819
<i>by pressing certain
shiatsu points on the head</i>

08:48.903 --> 08:51.739
<i>while applying a special blend of shampoo.</i>

08:52.573 --> 08:55.493
So that's why you forgot who I am!

08:55.576 --> 08:56.661
Who are you?

08:57.245 --> 08:58.913
Is there a cure for this?

08:58.996 --> 09:03.084
Can't say one way or another
without the shampoo.

09:03.167 --> 09:05.378
All right. Akane, come with me!

09:05.461 --> 09:06.629
What is it with you?

09:09.298 --> 09:10.383
Shampoo!

09:10.967 --> 09:13.719
- Where the hell are you?
- What is the matter with you?

09:14.345 --> 09:16.180
Hand over the shampoo!

09:17.265 --> 09:18.683
Shampoo!

09:20.351 --> 09:21.811
I'm back.

09:21.894 --> 09:23.187
Hello.

09:23.854 --> 09:26.190
She will be boarding here.

09:26.274 --> 09:28.693
This is Shampoo, a nurse-in-training.

09:28.776 --> 09:30.278
SMALL WORLD... ISN'T IT?

09:33.072 --> 09:34.365
I'm home.

09:36.284 --> 09:37.535
Akane!

09:37.618 --> 09:40.204
I heard you forgot all about Ranma.

09:41.205 --> 09:43.165
Ranma? Who's that?

09:44.750 --> 09:48.713
Let's see,
who is this boy standing behind you?

09:52.383 --> 09:55.219
Why are you coming into my house?

09:55.720 --> 09:57.763
I'm lodging here.

09:57.847 --> 09:59.098
Oh my.

09:59.181 --> 10:01.267
Wow, she really doesn't remember him.

10:03.644 --> 10:06.230
This isn't a problem, Akane.

10:07.023 --> 10:10.151
It's not like you forgot me, right?

10:10.234 --> 10:11.527
Mister, who are you?

10:13.029 --> 10:15.615
Dad, I was just kidding. It's a joke!

10:15.698 --> 10:16.907
Guess she's doing all right.

10:17.408 --> 10:18.909
<i>Damn it.</i>

10:18.993 --> 10:21.329
<i>Where the hell is Shampoo?</i>

10:21.412 --> 10:22.830
GUESS WHO?

10:22.913 --> 10:25.750
What the hell, baldy!

10:25.833 --> 10:27.168
HOO HOO! HE FELL FOR IT!

10:27.251 --> 10:29.170
I got you good!

10:29.754 --> 10:31.589
Shampoo, you!

10:32.089 --> 10:33.424
My husband.

10:37.136 --> 10:38.429
What are you doing?

10:39.513 --> 10:41.098
Wait, who are you again?

10:41.599 --> 10:43.017
Seriously...

10:43.100 --> 10:45.770
<i>What is the matter with me?</i>

10:46.270 --> 10:48.939
<i>I saw them hugging, and I lost my temper.</i>

10:50.024 --> 10:51.776
That was a conditioned reflex.

10:51.859 --> 10:55.196
Deep down, she still remembers Ranma.

10:55.279 --> 10:58.240
Could you be the ramen topping--

10:58.324 --> 10:59.867
You're thinking of menma.

11:00.368 --> 11:03.204
<i>She didn't completely
fall under my technique.</i>

11:03.287 --> 11:04.914
<i>She's a formidable woman.</i>

11:05.414 --> 11:06.749
<i>Fine, I'll use it once again!</i>

11:07.249 --> 11:09.627
Xi Fa Shiang Gao Shiatsu!

11:13.506 --> 11:15.841
Now that I have this shampoo...

11:17.093 --> 11:18.010
Husband!

11:22.807 --> 11:24.558
Ouch, ouch, that hurts!

11:24.642 --> 11:26.477
What the hell was that for?

11:27.520 --> 11:30.564
Ranma, that shampoo won't do the trick.

11:30.648 --> 11:32.108
Dr. Tofu.

11:32.608 --> 11:35.569
See the blend number on the bottle.

11:36.612 --> 11:38.322
110?

11:38.406 --> 11:44.412
To recover her lost memories,
we need the 119 blend.

11:44.495 --> 11:45.329
Right, right.

11:45.413 --> 11:47.289
Where can I find it?

11:47.873 --> 11:51.419
Don't you fret.
The formula is in this book.

11:51.502 --> 11:55.673
Dr. Tofu, that's just what we need
to make Akane better!

11:55.756 --> 11:57.007
Kasumi?

11:57.508 --> 12:00.177
So, why are you here?

12:00.261 --> 12:03.180
Well, this is my house.

12:03.264 --> 12:06.267
This is your house. That's...

12:06.350 --> 12:10.020
What are you tearing up the book for?

12:14.650 --> 12:17.528
What's this, Ranma?
Why are you packing up?

12:18.279 --> 12:19.780
Isn't it obvious?

12:20.990 --> 12:24.452
I'm going to a pharmacy in China
to buy the 119 blend.

12:25.828 --> 12:27.705
Don't forget my souvenir!

12:27.788 --> 12:28.706
HOW ABOUT SOME GRECIAN FORMULA?

12:28.789 --> 12:30.207
- Oolong tea for me.
- Shanghai crab crackers?

12:30.291 --> 12:31.292
For me, cigarettes...

12:31.375 --> 12:35.254
Panda cookies or egg tarts?
How about shiitake?

12:35.337 --> 12:38.966
<i>Why is he willing to go this far?</i>

12:40.342 --> 12:41.552
Akane.

12:43.012 --> 12:46.807
Hold on tight.
I promise you're gonna remember me.

12:51.270 --> 12:52.897
BRINGS A TEAR TO YOUR EYE,
DON'T IT?

12:52.980 --> 12:54.690
Ranma! You've said it, my man!

12:54.773 --> 12:58.194
I wanna hear more! Come on,
let me hear it. Loud and clear!

13:00.029 --> 13:01.447
<i>I want to...</i>

13:04.950 --> 13:06.660
<i>remember who he is.</i>

13:09.538 --> 13:12.917
<i>The problem is how to reach China
without spending a dime.</i>

13:13.417 --> 13:16.545
<i>Guess I gotta swim like the last time.</i>

13:17.171 --> 13:20.508
<i>It isn't easy, but it'll have to do...</i>

13:20.591 --> 13:22.927
<i>It's the only way to get that 119 stuff.</i>

13:31.101 --> 13:34.021
119?

13:34.563 --> 13:35.814
Gimme!

13:37.650 --> 13:39.860
Wait, Shampoo!

13:54.500 --> 13:55.793
You gonna grab it?

13:55.876 --> 13:59.046
You think you can stop me like this?

13:59.129 --> 14:01.924
I may not look it,
but I'm quite used to a woman's body!

14:02.007 --> 14:03.759
I'll actually do it!

14:05.719 --> 14:07.012
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

14:12.017 --> 14:15.062
All right! Here's what we'll do.

14:15.145 --> 14:17.481
I'll grant you just one wish.

14:17.982 --> 14:19.149
Promise?

14:19.692 --> 14:21.610
A man keeps his words.

14:21.694 --> 14:25.281
I'll do anything as long as it's not
"marry me" or "kill Akane".

14:27.241 --> 14:28.492
In that case...

14:32.955 --> 14:35.499
kill the girl Ranma for me.

14:40.254 --> 14:42.464
What?

14:43.966 --> 14:45.134
DOJO ENTRANCE THIS WAY

14:45.634 --> 14:50.723
That means Shampoo hasn't caught on...

14:50.806 --> 14:53.183
That I turn into a girl.

14:54.518 --> 14:59.607
Kill the girl Ranma for me,
and I'll give you the 119 blend.

15:00.274 --> 15:01.567
Do we have a deal?

15:02.192 --> 15:03.819
All right, deal.

15:03.903 --> 15:06.238
How 'bout we meet in the middle
and shake on half-dead?

15:06.822 --> 15:08.908
I don't really get it, but sure.

15:09.408 --> 15:13.996
Well you heard me.
Ryoga, beat me to a pulp.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.289
Hell no.

15:15.873 --> 15:19.960
Just give it up and hand Akane to me.

15:20.586 --> 15:23.297
A new love is about to bloom!

15:23.380 --> 15:25.841
Ranma? Who is he?

15:26.342 --> 15:28.802
He's not worth remembering, darling.

15:31.972 --> 15:33.849
I'm begging you, please.

15:33.933 --> 15:35.976
And I said not a cat's chance in hell!

15:36.060 --> 15:39.396
Please, I beg of you! Beat me up!

15:44.693 --> 15:46.820
Yeah, I'll make sure you're a dead man!

15:46.904 --> 15:48.739
Yes, that's it!

15:54.203 --> 15:58.165
Idiot, you're not the one who's
supposed to get beaten up!

15:58.248 --> 16:02.044
Unless you beat me half to death,
I can't recover Akane's memory!

16:02.670 --> 16:04.129
Let us lend a hand.

16:04.630 --> 16:07.466
Thank you, Ranma.
You're willing to go this far for Akane!

16:07.549 --> 16:08.550
IT'S ALL SO SWEET!

16:09.385 --> 16:10.552
What are you doing?

16:11.095 --> 16:15.349
Akane. Here, isn't Ranma's
selflessness so very inspiring?

16:15.432 --> 16:16.850
Monster!

16:16.934 --> 16:18.394
Who's a monster?

16:18.477 --> 16:20.104
Then who are you?

16:25.567 --> 16:28.445
Dad, stop picking on the weak.

16:28.529 --> 16:30.239
I'll be your opponent instead.

16:30.948 --> 16:31.865
Hey, you...

16:32.783 --> 16:34.326
Butt out of it, stupid.

16:34.410 --> 16:35.411
What?

16:35.911 --> 16:39.289
Who do you think
I'm quietly getting beat up for?

16:41.875 --> 16:44.670
You really aren't cute!

16:44.753 --> 16:47.506
<i>Aren't cute!</i>

16:47.589 --> 16:49.174
"You aren't cute"...

16:54.054 --> 16:55.347
Unbelievable...

16:56.515 --> 16:58.058
Say it again, Ranma.

16:58.642 --> 16:59.935
You aren't cute!

17:01.270 --> 17:02.604
Once again!

17:02.688 --> 17:04.189
You aren't cute!

17:04.273 --> 17:06.442
<i>You aren't cute!</i>

17:06.525 --> 17:08.027
She's responding.

17:08.110 --> 17:11.030
Ranma, give her more
of your soul-stirring words!

17:11.113 --> 17:12.948
Okay, leave it to me.

17:13.032 --> 17:15.451
Plain Jane! Ferocious! Clumsy!

17:15.534 --> 17:16.910
No curves! Slowpoke!

17:16.994 --> 17:18.829
You bastard!

17:19.329 --> 17:21.915
How dare you shower
Akane with such terrible insults!

17:21.999 --> 17:23.292
Look, you're alive.

17:23.792 --> 17:26.670
<i>You aren't cute!</i>

17:26.754 --> 17:28.213
<i>You aren't cute!</i>

17:28.297 --> 17:29.465
You aren't cute.

17:29.548 --> 17:30.716
You aren't cute.

17:30.799 --> 17:31.967
You aren't cute!

17:32.051 --> 17:35.471
<i>Plain Jane.</i>

17:35.554 --> 17:36.722
Plain Jane.

17:36.805 --> 17:37.973
Plain Jane.

17:38.057 --> 17:42.978
<i>Plain Jane!</i>

17:44.688 --> 17:48.484
You... Stupid Ranma!

17:58.869 --> 18:02.289
Akane! You remember.
You know who Ranma is!

18:04.666 --> 18:07.044
Yes, yes! It's a miracle of love.

18:07.669 --> 18:08.670
You're heavy.

18:15.719 --> 18:16.887
Hello.

18:17.513 --> 18:18.639
Shampoo?

18:20.516 --> 18:22.935
Husband!

18:32.736 --> 18:36.490
So you remember Ranma.
What a persistent woman.

18:36.573 --> 18:38.867
Look who's talking!

18:39.618 --> 18:42.621
You leave me with no choice.
If you hadn't remembered,

18:42.704 --> 18:44.331
I wouldn't have to kill you!

18:52.214 --> 18:53.715
Stop it, Shampoo.

18:56.176 --> 18:57.803
I love you.

18:57.886 --> 18:59.972
Hold on, wait.

19:00.055 --> 19:02.349
Anyhow, stop messing with Akane.

19:03.016 --> 19:05.853
She got in my way, so I get rid of her.
So what?

19:07.771 --> 19:09.106
You leave me with no choice.

19:09.815 --> 19:11.567
I'll tell you the truth.

19:25.205 --> 19:27.040
Girl Ranma...

19:30.961 --> 19:33.255
That's right.
I didn't have the heart to tell you.

19:33.755 --> 19:36.008
The boy Ranma is just my cover.

19:36.592 --> 19:40.304
I'm actually a girl.

19:42.639 --> 19:44.975
Is he telling the truth, Genma?

19:45.058 --> 19:46.059
I HAD NO IDEA!

19:46.143 --> 19:49.771
So that's why I can't go out with...

19:56.987 --> 19:58.030
I'll kill you!

19:58.113 --> 19:59.740
No way!

19:59.823 --> 20:01.992
Wait, wait, wait!

20:48.497 --> 20:49.539
<i>Shampoo...</i>

20:56.546 --> 20:57.547
"<i>Bié le</i>"

20:59.174 --> 21:01.260
is Chinese for "farewell."

21:02.886 --> 21:06.390
It means "I'll never see you again."

21:10.644 --> 21:12.354
It isn't too late.

21:12.437 --> 21:14.231
Turn back into a guy and go stop her.

21:15.023 --> 21:16.024
Zip it.

21:26.702 --> 21:29.121
<i>It is a bit of a waste
to let her go, though.</i>

22:56.917 --> 23:01.922
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
